cutefish-meta (26.04.5) resolute; urgency=medium

  * cutefish-live: quote the installer autostart Exec with double quotes.
    Single quotes are not quoting in desktop entries (or QProcess::
    splitCommand), so the session ran sh -c "'grep" and the installer never
    opened by itself.

