cutefish-meta (26.04.3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * cutefish-hardware: drop cutefish-vbox-drmclient.service; VBoxService
    already starts VBoxDRMClient once virtualbox-guest-x11 is installed.
  * calamares-settings-cutefish: divert Calamares' "Install System" menu
    entry, which duplicated "Install Cutefish OS".
  * cutefish-desktop: ship a Cutefish lock screen for kscreenlocker
    (Plasma/Shell package org.cutefish.desktop). The greeter's built-in
    fallback needs Plasma workspace modules, so it crashed in a loop and the
    session could not be unlocked.

